Task:
Generate a complete, structured Markdown document titled `# Database Requirements Specification`.
The document must thoroughly cover the following sections:
1. Executive Summary & System Scope
2. Entities and Attribute Definitions (list every entity, its purpose, candidate keys, and known attributes)
3. Entity Relationships & Cardinalities (detail all 1:1, 1:N, and M:N links)
4. Workload, Data Volume & Growth Projections
5. Query Patterns, Read/Write Ratio & Reporting Needs
6. Transactions, Concurrency & ACID Consistency Requirements
